use anyhow :: { Context , Result } ; use std :: path :: { Path , PathBuf } ; use std :: fs ; use std :: process :: Command ; use std :: collections :: HashSet ; use super :: * ; use tempfile :: tempdir ; # [doc = " Verify build succeeds"] fn verify_build (workspace_path : & Path) -> Result < () > { println ! ("  🔨 Verifying build...") ; let output = Command :: new ("cargo") . args (["check" , "--workspace"]) . current_dir (workspace_path) . output () ; match output { Ok (out) if out . status . success () => { println ! ("  ✅ Build verification passed") ; } Ok (out) => { let stderr = String :: from_utf8_lossy (& out . stderr) ; println ! ("  ⚠️  Build check failed (may be expected for minimal crates)") ; println ! ("     Error: {}" , stderr . lines () . next () . unwrap_or ("unknown")) ; } Err (e) => { println ! ("  ⚠️  Could not run cargo check: {}" , e) ; } } Ok (()) }